{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Introduction:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a level crossing game that combines third person shooter and platform jumping, and the game progresses linearly according to the order of the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Description of game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The storyline of the game follows a linear progression through levels in order;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some levels require clever jumping sequences to pass;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some levels require the correct weapon selection to pass;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the process of passing levels, players can unlock more weapons;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the process of passing levels, players can encounter more map elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Version Description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version includes: 5 levels, 4 weapons, and 1 equipment;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The official version includes: all levels, all weapons, and all equipment;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completed content: 10 levels, 4 weapons (swords, rifles, rockets, grenades), 1 equipment (jetpack);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Development plan: In the official version, an additional 5 levels will be added, bringing the total to 15 levels.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628020?t=1744940270","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628020?t=1744940270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628020/19070585d1d583473deb1a5a7565690c7bfbe19c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744940270","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628020/19070585d1d583473deb1a5a7565690c7bfbe19c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744940270","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3628090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Introduction:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a level crossing game that combines third person shooter and platform jumping, and the game progresses linearly according to the order of the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Description of game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The storyline of the game follows a linear progression through levels in order;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some levels require clever jumping sequences to pass;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some levels require the correct weapon selection to pass;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the process of passing levels, players can unlock more weapons;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the process of passing levels, players can encounter more map elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Version Description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version includes: 5 levels, 4 weapons, and 1 equipment;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The official version includes: all levels, all weapons, and all equipment;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completed content: 10 levels, 4 weapons (swords, rifles, rockets, grenades), 1 equipment (jetpack);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Development plan: In the official version, an additional 5 levels will be added, bringing the total to 15 levels.</p>","developers":["CHEN JIE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628020/3762c03ac36ff5847c2452aa5f7c06c9a72871ca/header.jpg?t=1744940270","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126147,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126147/movie480.mp4?t=1744